A read-set cannot record a file a check looked for and failed to find, so the
skip refuses to fire when the path set itself moved. ccache documents that
hole and accepts it.

Green is never rendered bare: independence, relevance and discrimination
travel with it. Nothing gates.

Background grading uses no daemon of ours. launchd already runs, so a
WatchPaths agent starts a short-lived gr and it exits; idle CPU is zero
